From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:30:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [th02/main] Put the whole main_03 group into one main_03_TEXT
 segment

With ZUN's single physical segment, TLINK emits NOP / PUSH CS / CALL near
for every far call within the group, so the inline-asm stand-ins for
sub_13ABB(), sub_129FC(), sub_17A55(), bullets_clear() and mima_end() are
plain calls again, including the ones that pass arguments.
---
